## Result

The domain adaptation workflow was successfully implemented. A base text classification model was trained and subsequently adapted using cybersecurity-specific data.

The adapted model successfully classified new cybersecurity-related queries into categories such as `secure` and `threat`.

This experiment demonstrates how adapting a model with domain-specific data can make it suitable for specialized applications such as cybersecurity text classification.
